  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed side extension, due to its inappropriate siting, would not blend with the host property and the wider area and would disrupt the symmetry of the pair of semis, harmful to the overall character of the site and surrounding area, as well as significantly impact the living conditions of 10 Stratton Close, contrary to the Residential Extensions Guidelines SPD and Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations).  ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed two storey side extension, due to its inappropriate position and design, would harm neighbours' living conditions at 10 Stratton Close, in terms of loss of light, outlook and increased sense of enclosure, contrary to the Local Plan policy CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines."
